netease-cloud-music-gtk
=====================

Rolling Git SlackBuild for the native Rust/GTK4 NetEase Cloud Music player.
Each online run fetches the latest commit on upstream's default branch,
like an AUR -git package. The package version is the commit's short hash
(at least 12 characters), generated from the source used for that build.
Builds private GTK, libadwaita, GLib, Wayland and
GStreamer libraries under /opt/netease-cloud-music-gtk. Desktop integration
and the launcher are installed under /usr.

Requirements
------------

Rust >= 1.92, Cargo, Meson >= 1.1, Ninja, Python 3, a C/C++ toolchain,
Git, gettext, bison, flex, sassc, pkg-config and Slackware pkgtools.
System development libraries are also required, including GnuTLS >= 3.7.4,
GdkPixbuf >= 2.42, Graphene >= 1.10, Wayland protocols >= 1.36, FFmpeg,
X11, OpenSSL and audio codecs. The script checks major dependencies.

Build
-----

Run as a regular user from this directory:

  ./netease-cloud-music-gtk.SlackBuild

The upstream Git repository is cached in sources/netease-cloud-music-gtk.git.
Library archives are downloaded to sources/ and verified against sources.list.
Cargo uses upstream's Cargo.lock when present, or generates one in the build
directory when absent. The build then uses --locked to keep that resolution
consistent for the rest of the build. The resolved lock file is included in the
package documentation. The package is written to /tmp; build files and logs
remain under /tmp/SBo. The .info file uses "git" as a version placeholder;
the SlackBuild calculates the actual package version at build time.

Useful options:

  JOBS=8 OUTPUT=/tmp ./netease-cloud-music-gtk.SlackBuild
  FETCH_ONLY=yes ./netease-cloud-music-gtk.SlackBuild
  OFFLINE=yes CARGO_HOME=/path/to/cache ./netease-cloud-music-gtk.SlackBuild

OFFLINE=yes or DOWNLOAD=no reuses the cached upstream commit without fetching.
Offline builds require the Git source, all library archives and Cargo
dependencies for the selected commit to be cached. FETCH_ONLY fetches the
Git source and library archives only, not Cargo dependencies.

Install and run
---------------

Replace COMMIT_HASH with the package version printed by the build:

  sudo upgradepkg --install-new /tmp/netease-cloud-music-gtk-COMMIT_HASH-x86_64-1_SBo.txz
  netease-cloud-music-gtk4

The launcher sets private library and plugin paths for the application.
The build script does not install packages or upgrade system libraries.

Tested on an updated Slackware 15.0 x86_64 system. See BUILD-RESULTS.md
for build and runtime verification results.
